{
  "id": "E399",
  "title": "Are You Home?",
  "level": "newbie",
  "date": "2020-02-06",
  "synopsis": "What’s the best way to test if someone is really at home?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/50399/09f0eba0f340ac77a802ad2526f0c10e02d4262c.mp3?1580462887",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "你真的在家吗？\n\n小明的妈妈：下个星期我要去美国。你要在家里。不要出去喝酒。\n小明的爸爸：好的。我一定在家。\n（一个星期后）\n小明的爸爸：喂？晚上十一点了，你怎么还打电话？\n小明的妈妈：你在哪儿呢？\n小明的爸爸：我在家啊。\n小明的妈妈：好，你去看看，桌子下面有什么？\n小明的爸爸：你等一下……桌子下面有几本书。\n小明的妈妈：几本？\n小明的爸爸：桌子下面有七本书。你问这个做什么？\n小明的妈妈：现在我知道你在家了。好了，你去睡觉吧。",
    "traditional": "你真的在家嗎？\n\n小明的媽媽：下個星期我要去美國。你要在家裡。不要出去喝酒。\n小明的爸爸：好的。我一定在家。\n（一個星期後）\n小明的爸爸：喂？晚上十一點了，你怎麼還打電話？\n小明的媽媽：你在哪兒呢？\n小明的爸爸：我在家啊。\n小明的媽媽：好，你去看看，桌子下面有什麼？\n小明的爸爸：你等一下……桌子下面有幾本書。\n小明的媽媽：幾本？\n小明的爸爸：桌子下面有七本書。你問這個做什麼？\n小明的媽媽：現在我知道你在家了。好了，你去睡覺吧。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Are you really at home?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小明的妈妈：下个星期我要去美国。你要在家里。不要出去喝酒。",
      "traditional": "小明的媽媽：下個星期我要去美國。你要在家裡。不要出去喝酒。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng de mā ma xià ge xīng qī wǒ yào qù měi guó nǐ yào zài jiā lǐ bú yào chū qù hē jiǔ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming’s Mom: I’m going to the US next week. You should stay at home. Don’t go out to drink."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小明的爸爸：好的。我一定在家。",
      "traditional": "小明的爸爸：好的。我一定在家。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng de bà ba hǎo de wǒ yí dìng zài jiā",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming’s Dad: OK. I will stay at home for sure."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "（一个星期后）",
      "traditional": "（一個星期後）",
      "pinyin": "yí ge xīng qī hòu",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "(One week later)"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小明的爸爸：喂？晚上十一点了，你怎么还打电话？",
      "traditional": "小明的爸爸：喂？晚上十一點了，你怎麼還打電話？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng de bà ba wéi wǎn shang shí yī diǎn le nǐ zěn me hái dǎ diàn huà",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming’s Dad: Hello? It's 11 pm, why are you calling?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "小明的妈妈：你在哪儿呢？",
      "traditional": "小明的媽媽：你在哪兒呢？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng de mā ma nǐ zài nǎ'r ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming’s Mom: Where are you?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "小明的爸爸：我在家啊。",
      "traditional": "小明的爸爸：我在家啊。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng de bà ba wǒ zài jiā a",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming’s Dad: I’m at home."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "小明的妈妈：好，你去看看，桌子下面有什么？",
      "traditional": "小明的媽媽：好，你去看看，桌子下面有什麼？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng de mā ma hǎo nǐ qù kàn kan zhuō zi xià miàn yǒu shén me",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming’s Mom: Good. Go and take a look, what’s under the table?"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "小明的爸爸：你等一下……桌子下面有几本书。",
      "traditional": "小明的爸爸：你等一下……桌子下面有幾本書。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng de bà ba nǐ děng yí xià zhuō zi xià miàn yǒu jǐ běn shū",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming’s Dad: Wait a moment… There are a few books under the table."
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "小明的妈妈：几本？",
      "traditional": "小明的媽媽：幾本？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng de mā ma jǐ běn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming’s Mom: How many?"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "simplified": "小明的爸爸：桌子下面有七本书。你问这个做什么？",
      "traditional": "小明的爸爸：桌子下面有七本書。你問這個做什麼？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng de bà ba zhuō zi xià miàn yǒu qī běn shū nǐ wèn zhè ge zuò shén me",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming’s Dad: There are 7 books under the table. Why are you asking about this?"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "simplified": "小明的妈妈：现在我知道你在家了。好了，你去睡觉吧。",
      "traditional": "小明的媽媽：現在我知道你在家了。好了，你去睡覺吧。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng de mā ma xiàn zài wǒ zhī dào nǐ zài jiā le hǎo le nǐ qù shuì jiào ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming’s Mom: Now I know that you’re at home. OK, you can go to bed."
    }
  ],
